Attribution:

- Enclosure in hardware/case/ is a remix of "veltoc" by danking6
  (https://github.com/danking6/veltoc), MIT licensed. Encoder/display UX
  patterns in the firmware are also ported from veltoc.
- Firmware architecture (Thread LIT ICD configuration, battery-aware Matter
  endpoints) informed by "TinyENV_Sensor-Thread" by charles-waite
  (https://github.com/charles-waite/TinyENV_Sensor-Thread).
- firmware/sensor-01 build scaffolding derived from the icd_app example in
  espressif/esp-matter (Apache-2.0 / Public Domain example code).
- firmware/components/monogfx/font5x7.c is the classic 5x7 bitmap font from
  Adafruit-GFX (glcdfont.c), BSD license, Copyright (c) 2012 Adafruit
  Industries.
- firmware/components/ssd1680 command sequences cross-checked against
  Adafruit_EPD (MIT, Copyright (c) 2018 Adafruit Industries) and the
  Solomon Systech SSD1680 datasheet.
